  "_readme": [
    "Biome trait table shared by the biome-rule worldgen systems: Creative Delight's wild crops",
    "(kubejs/data/creative_delight/kubejs/_worldgen/wild_crops.json), mushroom_spawns.json, wild_flowers.json, bee_nests.json and",
    "mob_spawns.json, and their generators in tools/. A rule's 'where' clause means the same thing in every file.",
    "",
    "biomes: every overworld biome -> its traits, space separated. Biomes marked 'ocean' or 'cave' never match a surface rule:",
    "  the features are placed at the surface, which is water or another biome there.",
    "  climate: cold | temperate | warm.  moisture: wet | dry (neither = moderate).  snowy.",
    "  ground: grassy sandy terracotta gravelly rocky icy muddy mycelium.",
    "  shape: forest plains mountain peak beach cliff coastal river swamp jungle desert badlands savanna shrubland",
    "         oasis mushroom sky.  trees: oak birch dark_oak coniferous cherry.  other: flower autumn.",
    "  A biome missing from this list (new mod) is reported by tools/gen_crop_worldgen_table.py and by the wild crop",
    "  script at world load; it matches no rule."
  ],

